    <string name="ob_welcome_desc">A smart, fast and smooth Persian &amp; English keyboard — designed for big fingers.\n\n• Smart touch detection and auto-correction\n• Word prediction and swipe typing\n• Fully offline — no data ever leaves your device</string>
